              "user_id": "amzn1.account.DEMO-USER-001",
              "context": "Dinner plan in progress: Vegan Pasta Primavera for 4. Ingredients: pasta, tomatoes, basil, olive oil, garlic, zucchini. Shopping list not yet updated.",
